WEBVTT

00:00.500 --> 00:04.331
A fraction tells us about equal parts of a whole.

00:04.781 --> 00:11.329
Here is a pizza cut into four equal parts. Equal means every part is the same size.

00:11.779 --> 00:16.516
Let's shade one part. One out of the four parts is shaded.

00:16.966 --> 00:23.519
We write that as one fourth. The bottom number says how many equal parts there are in all.

00:23.519 --> 00:28.251
The top number says how many of those parts we are talking about.

00:28.701 --> 00:34.753
Now shade three parts. That is three fourths. The bottom number is still four,

00:34.753 --> 00:38.244
because the pizza still has four equal parts.

00:38.694 --> 00:46.078
Remember: the bottom number counts all the equal parts. The top number counts the parts we pick.
